# Build context for infra/Dockerfile. The context is the repository root
# because the uv workspace spans sdk/ and backend/ and uv.lock at the root
# pins both.
#
# Two rules worth keeping in mind when editing this file:
#   - anything excluded here cannot be COPYed in the Dockerfile;
#   - a secret that reaches the context can end up in an image layer, so
#     .env and friends are excluded unconditionally.

# ── secrets: never in the context, let alone a layer ──────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── version control and CI ────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── virtualenvs and caches: rebuilt inside the image ──────────────────
.venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[codz]
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
backend/.pytest-tmp/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.uv/

# ── generated run artifacts. Large, and never image content ───────────
runs/
benchmark-results/
wandb/
backend/wandb/
graphify-out/

# ── the dashboard is a separate deployable; not in this image ─────────
frontend/

# ── docs and design records ───────────────────────────────────────────
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# ── OS / editor junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.kilo/
.kilocode/
